      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Should we hire in-house or agency for LinkedIn?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">For Founder/CEO, Managing Director, Chief Executive, Co-founder, Executive Chairman, Second-generation family-business CEO, hybrid works best: (1) You (senior professional) provide raw material + final approval. (2) Agency handles execution — writing, design, production, publishing, engagement, community management. (3) EA/marketing manager on client side coordinates weekly. Pure in-house requires hiring 2-3 person LinkedIn team (writer + designer + video editor) = Rs 3-8 lakh/month cost. Agency at Rs 30K-1.2L/mo delivers similar output with industry expertise + compliance. Break-even for in-house: only above ~Rs 2 crore/year LinkedIn-attributed revenue with need for full custom control.</div>
      </div>
